{"id":"z15-11","volume":15,"volumeTitle":"汉纪七","volumeSubtitle":"前159","index":11,"title":{"t":"文帝後五年","s":"文帝后五年"},"book":{"t":"資治通鑑","s":"资治通鉴"},"sourceHead":{"t":"漢紀七 · 前159 · 壬午","s":"汉纪七 · 前159 · 壬午"},"author":"司马光","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"春天正月，文帝前往陇西；三月，前往雍县；秋天七月，前往代国。","tokens":[{"t":"春","s":"春","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"正","s":"正","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"月","s":"月","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"上","s":"上","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"行","s":"行","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"幸","s":"幸","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"隴","s":"陇","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"西","s":"西","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"；","s":"；","punct":true},{"t":"三","s":"三","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"月","s":"月","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"行","s":"行","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"幸","s":"幸","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"雍","s":"雍","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"；","s":"；","punct":true},{"t":"秋","s":"秋","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"七","s":"七","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"月","s":"月","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"行","s":"行","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"幸","s":"幸","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"代","s":"代","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]}],"lesson":{"background":"汉文帝后五年，前159年。这一年只记载文帝的行踪：春天正月到陇西，三月到雍县，秋天七月到代国。文帝一年三次出行，巡视边地和祭祀之所。","theme":"文帝这一年先到陇西，再到雍，又到代，陇西和代都是防御匈奴的边郡，雍是祭祀五帝的地方。史家只记行踪，却能让人看出文帝对边防和祭祀的重视。","technique":"全年只有一句，用三个分号把三次出行连起来，月份、地点依次排列，简洁明了，是编年体中以时间为纲、一句概括全年的典型写法。","keyContentWords":[{"word":"陇西","reading":"lǒng xī","note":"郡名，在今甘肃东南部。"},{"word":"代","reading":"dài","note":"诸侯国名，文帝即位前曾为代王。"},{"word":"行幸","reading":"xíng xìng","note":"帝王出行到某地。"}],"keyFunctionWords":[{"word":"上","reading":"shàng","note":"「上行幸陇西」，指皇帝，这里是文帝。"}],"ancientModern":[{"word":"幸","note":"「行幸代」，指皇帝亲临，不是今天的幸运。"}],"phoneticLoans":[],"flexibleUsage":[],"specialSyntax":[{"name":"省略句","note":"「三月，行幸雍」，省略主语上，承前一分句。"}]}}
